          "angle": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "bottom",
          "label": "bottom",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 90
        },
        {
          "id": "left",
          "label": "left",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "type-and-instance-presentation"
        },
        "markdown": "## Type and instance presentation\n\nFollow the semantic edges through three connected decisions:\n\n- **Document primitive:** one content node supporting Markdown, sanitized HTML, and plain text.\n- **Legend:** stable Twilite type glyphs only.\n- **Elements:** authored node icon views with glyph fallback, plus compact edge specimens rendered from actual edge style and meaning.\n\nThe governing rule is: the Legend explains what can be created; Elements shows what currently exists.",
        "title": "Reading This Idea"
      }
    },
